# GUNSHIP 40x32x2, top-down, facing down. Dusk armour, lens per launch bay.
# Relit from the first-iteration sketch: silhouette unchanged.
# light: top-left, shaded per plate. K outer contour only; inner seams use d.
# Frame 1 bays and stacks lit, frame 2 dim.
palette
. transparent
K #0b0d1a outline
d #261a2e shared-dark
b #4e4475 dusk-mid
m #867db2 dusk-light
o #ecdcc4 bone
X #45444e steel-mid
n #7c7a88 steel-light
g #4e9a1e core-dark
G #a8f030 core
w #f0ffb0 core-glint
ramp dusk d b m o
ramp steel d X n
ramp core g G w
frame lit 100
